Short:        Converts FD files to monam.libfile for MonAm 3.02beta
Author:       grodny@hron.fei.tuke.sk (Marek Grodny)
Uploader:     grodny hron fei tuke sk (Marek Grodny)
Type:         dev/asm
Version:      1.0
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Distribution: Anywhere. Freely Distributable.

  Converts exec_lib.fd, dos_lib.fd, intuition_lib.fd, graphics_lib.fd to
monam.libfile for user with MonAm 3.02beta, I didn`t try it on others
version, please try it, and send me e-mail.
